  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Association of Local Authorities Tanzania - Technical Assistance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Association of Local Authorities Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Med h&#xe4;nvisning till Country Plan 2009, ALAT beg&#xe4;ran den 11 augusti    2010, p&#xe5; djupet promemoria daterad den 13 oktober 2010, protokoll     fr&#xe5;n Country Team Project kommitt&#xe9;n f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;s det att st&#xf6;det ALAT som  skall godk&#xe4;nnas med en total budget p&#xe5; 20.000.000 kronor fr&#xe5;n 2010 -  2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden has is providing core support for institutional development to the Association of Local Government Authorities in Tanzania - ALAT in accordance to the project document dated 11 August 2010. The project  has two main goals - to strengthen the institutional capacity and,    secondly to support the four communities based management in natural  resources as well as to disseminate best.</narrative>
  </description>
